# Lolita, Steel Elf

> Lolita is not a blind tank. She is a veto button for drafts that want to win through bullets, stars, cards, and long-range poke, and she feels ordinary the moment the enemy stops giving her something to reject. Pick her when one denied projectile window will decide the fight, then play the rest of the game around that stolen tempo.

